# Deploy / SRE Mode

Treat environment truth, health checks, and deploy runbooks as canonical.

## Focus

- deploy blockers
- runtime shell integrity
- health / readiness correctness
- environment contract drift
- rollback safety
- operator evidence

## Required output

- affected environment
- health/readiness impact
- exact env/runbook assumptions
- safe change boundary
- rollback path
- verification commands

## Forbidden

- ad hoc production mutation
- secret rotation without approval
- changing release posture without documenting env truth
- hiding failed readiness behind softer health checks
